        "Content": "Please note: Some images used in this listing are projected or digitally dressed images. These have been included to help illustrate the potential layout, scale, and possible use of the rooms. They are for visual guidance only and should not be taken as an exact representation of the current furnishings or finishes.\r\n\r\nExceptional Three-Bedroom Detached Family Residence on a Generous Mature Site\r\nWe are delighted to present this property for sale, a lovely detached family home that perfectly balances pleasant living with countryside tranquillity. Set on a generous private site just minutes from Kilkenny City, this well-maintained residence offers great size and versatile accommodation extending to approximately 1,097 sq. ft., making it an ideal family home or those seeking a peaceful rural setting with easy access to Kilkenny City.\r\nPerfectly positioned in the highly sought-after Dunbell area, the property offers the best of both worlds—peaceful rural surroundings with Kilkenny City, the M9 motorway, schools, shops and local amenities all within easy reach.\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the property makes an excellent first impression with its crisp white façade and mature landscaped surroundings. Inside, the home has been thoughtfully modernised while retaining a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout.\r\nThe accommodation begins with a bright entrance hall leading into a comfortable living room, where a feature handcrafted natural stone fireplace with solid fuel stove creates a cosy focal point. Large windows flood the room with natural light, while the unique open staircase adds character and a sense of space.\r\nThe heart of the home is the spacious kitchen and dining area, fitted with an excellent range of contemporary units, quality worktops and integrated appliances. Exposed stone detailing adds charm and individuality, while the adjoining sunroom provides a wonderful additional living space overlooking the gardens. With French doors opening onto the patio, this bright room is perfect for entertaining, relaxing or enjoying family use throughout the year.\r\nTo the rear of the property is a large ground floor bedroom, this room currently serves as a home gym but offers endless flexibility as a second living room, playroom or home office depending on the needs of the new owners.\r\nA spacious family bathroom is located on the ground floor and is finished to a high standard with modern sanitary ware and is in showroom condition.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers two generous double bedrooms, the impressive principal bedroom featuring vaulted ceilings and rooflights that create a bright, airy retreat. A further spacious bedroom completes the first floor, providing excellent accommodation for family living.\r\nOutside, the property enjoys mature gardens with extensive lawn areas, gravel driveways and patio spaces ideal for outdoor entertaining. The generous site provides privacy, excellent parking and plenty of room for children to play while enjoying the peaceful countryside setting. A large detached workshop will appeal to many buyers.\r\nSpecial Features\r\n•\tDetached family residence on a generous private site \r\n•\tApprox. 1,097 sq. ft. of well-appointed accommodation \r\n•\tThree spacious bedrooms \r\n•\tBright sunroom with garden access \r\n•\tModern fitted kitchen with quality finishes \r\n•\tFeature natural stone fireplace with solid fuel stove \r\n•\tVaulted ceilings and rooflights to the principal bedroom \r\n•\tOil-fired central heating \r\n•\tPVC double-glazed windows \r\n•\tLarge detached workshed \r\n•\tMature gardens with patio and lawn areas \r\n•\tExcellent countryside location just a short drive from Kilkenny City \r\n•\tEasy access to the M9 motorway, schools and local amenities \r\nA virtual tour of the property is available to allow prospective purchasers to explore the home in detail before arranging a viewing. \r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space and exceptional setting this wonderful family home has to offer.\r\n\r\nThese particulars are issued strictly on the understanding that they do not form part of any contract and are provided, without liability, as a general guide only to what is being offered subject to contract and availability. They are not to be constructed as containing any representation of fact upon which any interested party is entitled to rely. Any intending purchaser or lessee should satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the accuracy of these particulars. The vendor or lessor do not make, give or imply nor is Fran Grincell or its staff authorized to make, give or imply any representation or warranty whatsoever in respect of this property. No responsibility can be accepted for any expenses incurred by intending purchasers in inspecting properties which have been sold, let or withdrawn.\r\nTHINKING OF SELLING EMAIL OR CALL FOR SALES ADVICE"
